WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
In one study, people watched a brief cross and missed
a tone playing through their headphones.
Attention can change what we notice.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.000
But that doesn't prove a meditation recording fixes attention.
Zen12 Premium's seller lists twelve levels and
forty-eight audio tracks in several styles.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Those are features, not clinical outcomes.
Try a free twelve-minute routine first.
If you still want a structured audio library,
compare the real checkout and refund terms.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Final Vestige hasn't verified partner approval
or product efficacy.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Until then, there is no purchase link here.
